{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"Les poètes sont encore vivants","Qu’est-ce que la poésie ? Quel est le rôle politique du poète ? Comment le fait d’être bilingue ou trilingue influe-t-il sur leur écriture ? Entretiens et poèmes se succèdent tout au long du film. À l’origine du projet, Xavier Gayan avait le désir de faire sentir ce qu’est la poésie aujourd’hui, ce qu’elle a d’unique par rapport aux autres arts, tous les courants qui la parcoure. Paroles, poésies, paysages… nous voyageons à travers les mots, les langues et le territoire. Nous entendons combien la langue nous façonne et à quel point les poètes permettent de l’éclairer, de la bouger, de la transformer et de nous libérer de son emprisonnement.",[4],"artistic creation",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":11,"filmType":15,"directors":16,"genre":24,"media":26,"synopsis":29,"production":30,"characters":33,"roles":34,"awards":85,"tags":3},"Film","FR2017_046","fr2017-046-les-poetes-sont-encore-vivants",{"native":1,"english":10},"",{"type":12,"date":13,"year":14},"Theatrical release","2017-03-08",2017,"Documentary",[17],{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":20,"gender":21,"nationality":22,"awards":23},"Xavier Gayan","xavier-gayan",0,"Male identifying","France",[],[25],"Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":27,"trailerUrl":28},"https://fr.web.img3.acsta.net/pictures/16/12/13/10/55/081490.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qu-zU0WCNQw",{"native":2,"english":10},[31],{"country":22,"share":32},"Majority coproducer",[],[35,42,49,57,63,69,75,79],{"person":36,"role":41},{"id":37,"slug":38,"name":37,"birthYear":39,"deathYear":20,"gender":21,"nationality":22,"awards":40},"Jacques Darras","jacques-darras",1939,[],"Documentary subject",{"person":43,"role":41},{"id":44,"slug":45,"name":44,"birthYear":46,"deathYear":20,"gender":21,"nationality":47,"awards":48},"Jean Portante","jean-portante",1950,"Luxembourg",[],{"person":5